{"server":"tw","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_05_end","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_05","title":"熄滅過去的燈","storyCode":"EP-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"9975936c989475d7815e03dfbe57619afb1f07280c4c7094fa654dafd6d208c4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"船隊內矛盾激化，雖然被船員們挾持的帕斯卡拉能言巧辯爭取了時間，但棘刺的煉金最終還是失敗了。哈維爾前往小鎮，為船員們在審判庭的追殺下開出一條生路。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，都到了這個地步，你們兩個就不要再掙扎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怪我把你們交給審判庭，說到底我們都不是一路人，各為各的前程而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們願意安靜下來，我就幫你們拿走嘴裡的布團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（猶豫地點頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不吵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"識相的話，就乖乖聽話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但魯斯先生，你有沒有想過，就算你們把我們和羅盤都交給審判庭，也不一定會有好的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們弟兄的屍體還掛在小鎮外面的旗杆上發臭，你真的認為審判庭不會把你們也掛上去嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有……不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死……那枚羅盤到底在哪裡？那個小子明明每晚煉完之後都會把羅盤送回這裡……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，你在找這個嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該這個時候回來的，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我怎麼覺得，自己回來得剛剛好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我……沒有選擇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下你的刀，小哈，你的刀法都是我教給你的，對上我你沒有絲毫勝算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我該試一試，你身上有傷，說不定打敗你也不是那麼困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，我不明白，究竟是怎樣的不滿讓你跟我走到了這一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像今天這般，刀劍相向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未對你有過不滿，你所做的每個決定我都願意支持，你的每個想法我都願意贊同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我的母親離開我，你牽起我的手，告訴我從此你就是我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從那個時候起，我對你就不會有任何不滿了，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你又是為了什麼呢，小哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了胡安娜……為了你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謊話，我就站在你面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你要如何為了我而與我敵對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的胡安娜，不會為了一己私慾讓整個船隊陷於危難，她是最英勇也最英明的首領，我們可以放心地跟隨她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是我認識的胡安娜，你只是一個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一個為了找尋往日激情，而忽視擺在面前的真實生活的可憐女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴過你很多次……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋不是我們的過去，它是我們的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是你的一廂情願，船隊中已經沒人再相信了。我們的父輩已經死去，從他們口中流傳出的故事也該一同消失了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把羅盤給我，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管上來，試試看你能不能拿到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜……你還不明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將羅盤交給審判庭，並不是我的一意孤行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場叛變……原來等著我的是這個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想要羅盤，而他們也只想要一個安穩的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成全大家，你依然是我們的首領，什麼都不會變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都不會變？小哈，你真的這麼想嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再欺騙自己了，至少我對你的信任再也不如從前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是對的，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，別怪弟兄們，海裡實在不是什麼好去處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是想離開鹽漠，好好過日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你們保證，只要放下你們手裡的武器，回你們各自的帳篷，我會當這一切從未發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動手吧，諸位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們誰都騙不了自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不好意思，我來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！放開我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啃鱗屎的，你這個混蛋敢綁老娘，還想被放開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾……你不是說這場叛變不會有人知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來時半路遇到魯斯先生在鹽漠裡面“迷路”，我順路帶他回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾，怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，動手前最好想清楚，你的朋友還在我們手裡呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！我們的事情輪不到外人插嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是殺回去燒光小鎮，拿回本來屬於我們的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一群人就為了一個給審判庭下跪的鱗屎計劃，和大姐頭在這裡較勁？是不是孬種啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾，我們剛被他們殺了那麼多弟兄，搶了那麼多物資，你就急著帶著所有人去投降？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜以前不是這樣教你的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在是一群連食物都沒有的傷兵殘將，殺回去和送死有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，要不是這個臭丫頭帶來了羅盤，那些審判庭神棍也不會來追殺我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，胡安娜女士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把這個丫頭丟出去就夠了，你們跟著投降幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，這不是辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，我們為什麼還沒把這個丫頭丟出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位，我有一些話想說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有你說話的份！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"海盜的刀劍不約而同地指向帕斯卡拉，令她的冷汗直冒。\n帕斯卡拉吞吞口水，在褲子上擦了擦手心的冷汗。\n她始終都清楚，想要的東西永遠只能靠自己去爭奪，去搶掠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是，她只是一個小丫頭，你們這是在幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小紅毛，你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧？這麼多成年人想出來的唯一辦法，就是把一個孩子交出去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，小紅毛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在為你說話欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我會為我自己說話的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朋友們，你們要把我交出去，我沒有意見，真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你們想揍扁我，那你們也要理解我為什麼拿爛東西矇騙你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暴力和虛偽，對，這就是我們活下去的辦法……除了這個以外，我們也找不到別的什麼出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但……你們也知道那個小鎮的實際情況，就算把我和羅盤交出去，你們的生活就能改善嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果不交的話，審判庭那些神棍又會一直追殺我們，大家也還是沒有好的結果，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的船員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這個死丫頭到底要說什麼？兩條路在你嘴裡都行不通！那要怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再等一週。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要一週，羅盤修復的結果就會出爐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，再給我一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果他成功，我們可以跟著羅盤的指引去海上，那些神棍再也找不到我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是他沒成功，你們再把我交出去也來得及！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們人都在這裡，我們也逃不出去的，再等一週又能怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亞，走出一片長不出糧食的土地，只會走進另一片長不出糧食的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亞外面，如果沒有錢，你的小命也不是你的！它屬於給你錢的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士她當然不想帶著大家一起死在海上……她的目的是什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她有多聰明，你們不是都很清楚嗎？她自己只會比你們每個人都混得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她可以成為你們每個人的大老闆，給你們錢，再捏住你們的小命……但她沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她只是想讓你們所有人都活得自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有了羅盤，你們怎麼就不能像你們的上一代一樣賺大錢呢？你們自稱海盜，但你們有誰見過海？別忘了自己是做什麼的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"說完，帕斯卡拉只覺得心臟幾乎跳出胸膛，身上的衣服也被冷汗浸透。\n房間陷入寂靜，她強裝出尷尬的訕笑，回頭看向身後的胡安娜、蒂奇、伊西多與極境。四人回以她肯定的眼神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……是不是很有道理……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一週的話，我沒意見，派人輪流盯著你們就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也沒有意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，我不同意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這樣就被說服了？這就是一個十多歲的小丫頭為了保命的謊話，你們覺得她懂羅盤，還是懂航海？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你們保證，只要我們把羅盤搶到手！拿去交給審判庭！我們就能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，哈維爾……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一位船員放下武器，緊接著是另一位，人們陸陸續續走出了船長室。\n哈維爾和胡安娜，相對而立。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一項任務交給你和魯斯，任務結束前你們不可以回到船隊，記住了嗎，哈維爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，去收拾行李吧，晚上你就該出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）哈維爾，走吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"一週後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g12_alchemyworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成果如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一週的期限快要到了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，我是說如果，我們失敗了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你千萬不能失敗啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士為了支持你傾盡了全力，想想她做的那些事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕走了哈維爾和魯斯，哪怕那是她最得力的手下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至……甚至她還殺死了自己的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，帕斯卡拉，別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他知道自己該怎麼做……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別在那裡唉聲嘆氣的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果會在今天出爐，難道你不著急嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急有什麼用？想想以後，那個羅盤真的修好了，未來的日子會是什麼光景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，但如果失敗的話……我們又該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，那些船員幾乎把外面堵得密不透風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道為什麼……我總有一股不好的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時候就不要說喪氣話了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗的最後幾天，他總是拒絕我們的幫助，一個人躲起來進行實驗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就連今天，他也不願意讓我們幫忙，只說實驗複雜，需要精密的操作，所以不希望有人打擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但根據我對他的瞭解……他這樣做只是因為不想牽連別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能，他已經做好了失敗的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但羅盤修復的流程不是還沒結束嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺就是這樣，做什麼都會先預想最糟糕的結局，然後提前做好準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g12_alchemyworkshop"},{"type":"narration","text":"轉瞬間，塑金台上層層疊疊的法術能量場悉數崩潰，剛剛還閃爍著金屬光澤的物質已然化作焦黑的泥。\n千鈞一髮之際，伊西多眼疾手快將探針收起，才不至於損毀工具，但剛剛拼湊起的羅盤零件都已支離破碎。\n撥弄著那攤黑泥，伊西多試圖分析失敗的原因。\n但那終歸只是一攤黑泥，他先前傾注其中的所有自認為精巧的構思，都已不見蹤跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我以為自己可以在這麼短的時間裡複製出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明老師說過……即使技藝最精湛的煉金術師也要花十幾年時間才能煉成心相原質……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鏽蝕的心相原質依舊在他的衣袋裡靜止不動，彷彿在嘲笑他的無能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"零件碎裂一地，青年頹坐在地，一切不言而喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，胡安娜女士，我失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，伊西多，這是我的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我願意承擔一切後果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g2_saltdesert_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這太冒險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到消息了。那個小子搞砸了，羅盤毀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就更不應該去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭的條件是交出羅盤和鹽船的設計圖，你手裡一樣也沒有，要拿什麼去談判？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們未必要把籌碼直接交到他們手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以讓他們親自去取。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來更像是個講道理的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想說我派來談判的弟兄太野蠻，可以不用這麼隱晦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是想說你理應明白，信譽是合作的基礎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果我沒有信譽，就不會親自來見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩手空空地來見我，還要求我親自進入鹽漠，去拿回你承諾的籌碼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道那裡會不會有幾十幾百個全副武裝的強盜，等著我自投羅網？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有可能，我是在向你透露海盜據點的位置，告訴你，不僅能拿到羅盤和圖紙，你還能驅使會駕駛鹽船的船員？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g2_saltdesert_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，哈維爾，我們做這些是為了給弟兄們謀一條安穩的出路，不是為了讓他們成為審判庭的囚徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總好過他們跟著一個沒有羅盤的胡安娜，全都死在海裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，既然這個道理你明白我明白，弟兄們不會不明白。審判庭的人去的時候，他們會配合的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那胡安娜呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我承諾了額外的籌碼，我也有額外的條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放過胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你要親自為我們帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，執裁官閣下，談判還沒結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與我無關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他絕不可能是誠心談判，他所謂的據點，只會是一處陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再說一遍，我們的人手和資源條件不夠進行一次大規模圍剿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我手下的人狀態都很好。你的人……我會確保他們能夠出戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不懷疑您的能力，但就算您能擊敗那些強盜，我們也無法再承受更多傷亡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候就算拿到了圖紙，我們也沒剩多少人手可以造船了，雅隆還是會繼續被困在這片鹽漠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的談判，你的交易，與我無關。既然已經知曉強盜據點的位置，我就應當行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強盜用於作惡的船，我會連同其圖紙一併焚毀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些強盜……我會清除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有這個權力！你驅使的教士，是在雅隆出生長大的人，是和我共患難的人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你卻如此不瞭解他們……不，你已經背叛了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還期望他們能聽從你的指令？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
